<title>USA: Duramed files estrogens application.</title>
<headline>Duramed files estrogens application.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duramed Pharmaceuticals Inc said on Monday that it had filed an investigational new drug application with the U.S. Food and Drug Administration to evaluate synthetic conjugated estrogens in the treatment of postmenopausal symptoms.</p>
<p>In addition, the company said information garnered in the research effort could serve as the basis for a new drug application filing, scheduled for the first quarter of 1998, the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
